# s_w8 / s_wl* / s_wb* integer helpers on an in-memory serializer (CORE).
# Each helper truncates its argument to its width; 24-bit helpers take a 32-bit value
# and emit only the low 3 bytes. l = little endian, b = big endian.
open array
w8 0x12
w8 0x1ff
dump
array_reset
wl16 0x1234
wl16 0x11234
wb16 0x1234
dump
array_reset
wl24 0x123456
wb24 0x123456
wl24 0xaa123456
wb24 0xaa123456
dump
array_reset
wl32 0x01020304
wb32 0x01020304
wl32 0xfffffffe
wb32 0
dump
array_reset
wl64 0x0102030405060708
wb64 0x0102030405060708
wl64 0xfffffffffffffffe
wb64 1
dump
close
